{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_ad9aa468127d0259-1637\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>鍾柔美（Yumi）近日身體力行發放正能量！她放低偶像包袱，化身義工為長者清理雜物。日前 Yumi 在社交網分享照片，只見她穿上全副武裝上陣，在狹小的空間內清理堆積如山的雜物，毫不介意污糟邋遢！</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_ad9aa468127d0259-1638\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>在如此侷促的環境下穿著保護衣進行勞動，對體力絕對是一項大考驗。完成清理工作後，Yumi 拉下口罩自拍，只見她熱到滿面通紅，全頭汗水濕透，顯得相當辛勞。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_ad9aa468127d0259-1638\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"40b601da-5f5b-4dd9-9be7-2da4371e3d0b.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026xMWXYSqD921790155534.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"40b601da-5f5b-4dd9-9be7-2da4371e3d0b.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"cecc462d-1173-4a62-997c-5959ae4be5df.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026KbGpfocecS1790155534.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cecc462d-1173-4a62-997c-5959ae4be5df.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_ad9aa468127d0259-1639\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>雖然過程並不輕鬆，但 Yumi 覺得一切都非常值得。她感性發文寫道：「雖然未做得最好，但願意行出多一步，已經好充實，好開心 有意義 ❤️前排去幫長者處理囤積既家居，面對堆積如山嘅雜物，唔單止係體力勞動，更加係一場耐性既考驗。」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_ad9aa468127d0259-1640\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>同時，她亦希望大家能一同伸出援助之手：「只要我地都願意出一分力，就可以為有需要既幫助既人帶黎溫暖🫶🏻 thanks everyone! 期待下一次再出發！」帖文曝光後，大批網民紛紛大讚她人美心善，好友陳若思亦留言力撐：「希望啲人知道你 其實比想像中善良🙌❤️❤️很棒。」</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T09:39:35.047301+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":422,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}